        "x": -430,
        "y": -1166
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Representations",
        "body": "Any node can be a ground. In practice it is a content node: markdown, html, an image or an svg. A Port or a note is a legal ground and is simply where a visitor arrives.",
